1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,875
Zamisli da Zemlja na samo jednu

2
00:00:01,875 --> 00:00:03,689
sekundu prestane da se okreće.

3
00:00:03,869 --> 00:00:05,888
Zvuči bezazleno, ali to bi bila

4
00:00:05,888 --> 00:00:08,427
najgora sekunda u istoriji čovečanstva.

5
00:00:08,607 --> 00:00:10,776
Ti stojiš na ekvatoru i krećeš

6
00:00:10,776 --> 00:00:13,163
se brzinom od oko 1600 kilometara

7
00:00:13,163 --> 00:00:13,669
na sat.

8
00:00:13,849 --> 00:00:15,803
Zemlja stane, ali ti ne staneš.

9
00:00:15,983 --> 00:00:18,551
Odjednom letiš kroz vazduh, zajedno sa

10
00:00:18,551 --> 00:00:20,646
kućama, drvećem i automobilima.

11
00:00:20,826 --> 00:00:22,808
Ali čekaj, to nije najgori deo.

12
00:00:22,988 --> 00:00:25,029
Okeani nastavljaju da se kreću i

13
00:00:25,029 --> 00:00:27,133
ogromni talasi udaraju u gradove.

14
00:00:27,313 --> 00:00:29,038
Dobra vest je da fizika kaže

15
00:00:29,038 --> 00:00:30,825
da je ovo praktično nemoguće.

16
00:00:31,005 --> 00:00:32,874
Napiši u komentarima šta bi ti

17
00:00:32,874 --> 00:00:34,494
uradio i zaprati GLAVONJU!
